      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Even after 150 years, Swedish heritage shapes Lindsborg’s architecture, traditions, businesses, churches, schools, and celebrations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitlindsborg.com/aboutlindsborgkansas",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lindsborg incorporated as a city in 1879, the same year the first railroad arrived.",
